; In an amount, a digit ends an unquoted commodity symbol, so EXV6_DE
; must be quoted in a posting, although a P directive takes it bare.  An
; underscore needs no quotes.  Nor can a symbol be a word of the value
; expression language, such as "and", unless it is quoted (#3321).

P 2025/04/29 EXV6_DE 48.50 EUR

2025/04/29 Buy
    Assets:Broker                     10 IBCS_DE @ 125.38 EUR
    Assets:Broker                    10 "EXV6_DE" @ 48.50 EUR
    Assets:Cash

2025/04/30 Buy
    Assets:Broker                     10 EXV6_DE @ 48.50 EUR
    Assets:Cash

2025/04/30 Buy
    Assets:Broker                          10 and
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 2
